Hello <%= @user.name %>,

We received a request to reset the password for your Roomies account.

Reset your password here:
<%= edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>

This link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.

If you did not request this change, you can ignore this email. Your password will stay the same.
